WEBVTT

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:13.790
Through the team of teenagers with attitudes.

00:01:10.330 --> 00:01:15.860
Citizens of Angel Grove Annual Children's Hospital Charity Motor Marathon.

00:01:26.660 --> 00:01:28.040
I've been taking care of all of this.

00:01:28.160 --> 00:01:29.740
Are you kidding? This is great.

00:01:30.440 --> 00:01:31.600
Time for a good talk.

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:32.420
Man, he said it.

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:33.880
I can't wait to hit those mountain trails.

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:38.370
Better be prepared to hit the dirt,

00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:40.240
because that's all you're going to hit.

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:40.940
Yeah.

00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:42.620
He'll be eating our dust

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:44.420
all the way across the finish line.

00:01:45.670 --> 00:01:48.640
Because you guys,

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:49.540
this is not about winning.

00:01:55.720 --> 00:01:56.760
Well, you got a hand to them.

00:01:57.110 --> 00:01:58.430
They certainly won't lack for confidence.

00:01:59.480 --> 00:01:59.980
That's for sure.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:02.030
Guys, we got work to do.

00:02:02.860 --> 00:02:04.580
Right, let's take a look at our maps.

00:02:16.890 --> 00:02:17.330
We...

00:02:18.060 --> 00:02:18.740
We...

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:20.280
Them finally!

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:28.720
This could only mean one thing.

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:29.940
Lord said the truth.

00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:31.180
The bird has returned!

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:02.020
Get set, go!

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:04.730
Hold on, Bryce, or Will?

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:42.380
Zed, fail to complete the mission assigned to you.

00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:44.440
I will now resume command.

00:03:44.760 --> 00:03:46.960
Prepare the palace for my return.

00:03:57.800 --> 00:03:58.420
Dane.

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:05.090
Where's his chamber of command?

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:08.000
I got such a headache!

00:04:08.990 --> 00:04:10.870
With it, I'm going to meet my emperor!

00:04:11.290 --> 00:04:12.090
Hey, wait for me!

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:14.800
You should check this guy out! Come on!

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:19.920
What the heck was that?

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:22.440
Hey guys, pull off!

00:04:35.630 --> 00:04:36.750
I don't know. Did you hear that?

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:39.870
Well, it might be thunder, but I don't think so.

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:42.240
We should probably keep an eye on our communicators

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:43.580
in case Jordan tries to get in touch.

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:46.540
I agree. Something doesn't feel right.

00:04:47.460 --> 00:04:48.580
Let's be sure we stick together.

00:04:49.960 --> 00:04:53.360
According to my calculations, the next clue should be that formation of rocks up there.

00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:55.180
Let's go.

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:33.450
Welcome you back by a bird!

00:06:01.180 --> 00:06:03.460
I am Lord Zed. Identify yourself.

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:08.340
Excellency, surely you remember me, Goldar, your faithful servant.

00:06:08.540 --> 00:06:11.280
Ah, yes, Goldar, the groveling one.

00:06:11.360 --> 00:06:14.440
I surrender myself to serve and obey you only.

00:06:14.800 --> 00:06:17.200
It is good to have you back, Lord Zed.

00:06:17.800 --> 00:06:22.080
Your spineless, sniveling attitude leads me to believe you will serve me well.

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:22.800
Yes.

00:06:23.400 --> 00:06:26.760
For that, I shall restore to you what was once taken away.

00:06:29.380 --> 00:06:29.960
Zed, I...

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:38.520
Thank you you not regret this see that I don't now where are the earthlings that the incompetent

00:06:38.520 --> 00:06:40.880
Rita Repulsa wasn't able to defeat

00:06:40.880 --> 00:06:52.070
Then can I be of service to you traitor

00:06:52.070 --> 00:06:56.330
Zed give me another chance

00:06:56.330 --> 00:06:57.950
I will not fail again

00:06:57.950 --> 00:06:59.980
Quiet those power rangers

00:07:00.030 --> 00:07:01.530
and nothing but mere infants.

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:03.450
You were defeated by children.

00:07:04.030 --> 00:07:06.230
You dare call yourself an empress of evil?

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:08.890
You are not fit to destroy a cockroach.

00:07:08.890 --> 00:07:11.230
I have always said that, my lord.

00:07:11.590 --> 00:07:12.970
You gold-bellied rat.

00:07:14.350 --> 00:07:16.470
You have made me very angry.

00:07:19.670 --> 00:07:20.910
How very interesting.

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:23.170
Chamber of Command changes its color

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:24.710
along with Lord Zed's moon.

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:29.720
Alpha, activate the intergalactic scanners.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:30.780
Take the way, Sordon.

00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:35.140
If my suspicions are correct, we may have some very dire circumstances to deal with.

00:07:35.530 --> 00:07:37.370
Contact the Power Rangers at once.

00:07:37.610 --> 00:07:40.950
Yes, Sordon. I'll locate them and transport them here immediately.

00:07:41.610 --> 00:07:51.340
Hang on, Alpha. I'll round up the others.

00:08:06.620 --> 00:08:07.360
The ridge is going on.

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:10.200
Rangers, teleport to the command center immediately.

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:11.630
This is an emergency.

00:08:11.990 --> 00:08:12.610
We're on our way.

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:14.560
What do you think it could be?

00:08:15.250 --> 00:08:15.650
I don't know.

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:16.720
Claire, time it.

00:08:18.190 --> 00:08:29.960
Claire, what's going on?

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:30.680
What's going on, Zordod?

00:08:30.920 --> 00:08:31.820
What's the emergency?

00:08:32.340 --> 00:08:35.260
Power Rangers, the thing I have feared most has happened.

00:08:35.720 --> 00:08:37.120
Lord Zedd has returned.

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:39.110
Who's Lord Zedd?

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:42.730
Rita and her minions, Lord and Master.

00:08:43.220 --> 00:08:44.980
You mean there's somebody worse than Rita?

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:46.320
I'm afraid so.

00:08:47.070 --> 00:08:50.030
Lord Zedd has been ruling over darker places within another galaxy.

00:08:50.600 --> 00:08:53.480
Eons ago, he left Rita in charge to carry out his orders.

00:08:53.980 --> 00:08:55.560
Since she has failed to do so...

00:08:55.560 --> 00:08:56.800
He's come back to finish the job.

00:08:57.360 --> 00:08:58.760
Will we be able to defeat him, Zordod?

00:08:59.040 --> 00:08:59.980
I do not know, Rita.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:04.840
I'm afraid your Zords may not be powerful enough to defeat Lord Zed's magic.

00:09:06.090 --> 00:09:09.970
Lord Zed's power is unmatched by anything we've ever seen before.

00:09:18.380 --> 00:09:20.820
Poor old Zordon is still around, eh?

00:09:21.140 --> 00:09:26.200
Little does he realize his pitiful teenage do-gooders are no match for me.

00:09:26.650 --> 00:09:29.970
Might I suggest we send out a group of buddies to a...

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:33.680
Attack the Rangers! They're in the open and will be easy prey!

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:41.170
Ha ha ha ha! Your putties are as useless to me as you are!

00:09:41.410 --> 00:09:45.810
I have my own army of putties, the likes of which you have never seen!

00:09:46.510 --> 00:09:47.350
Of course!

00:09:47.610 --> 00:09:49.030
Observe, you simply fool!

00:10:41.550 --> 00:10:42.190
That's what you've got.

00:10:44.980 --> 00:10:46.540
Better hope those four-wheelers start.

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:51.060
Oh, there's just a little dent.

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:56.840
Just a dent, huh?

00:10:59.320 --> 00:10:59.620
Uh-uh.

00:11:00.030 --> 00:11:00.870
I think it's oil.

00:11:03.520 --> 00:11:04.930
What are we supposed to do now?

00:11:05.150 --> 00:11:07.160
Never make it to the finish.

00:11:07.540 --> 00:11:09.950
Ah, we still have the map.

00:11:10.710 --> 00:11:12.110
Maybe we can make it there by foot.

00:11:14.550 --> 00:11:16.090
Bulky, I think something weird is going on.

00:11:17.250 --> 00:11:18.740
Yeah, I'm looking at it.

00:11:20.580 --> 00:11:22.880
Come on, come on.

00:11:24.640 --> 00:11:25.320
Okay, okay, okay.

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:25.980
Okay, follow me.

00:11:26.320 --> 00:11:27.500
Okay, I got it.

00:11:37.320 --> 00:11:41.610
Finish the show, gold monkey!

00:11:43.410 --> 00:11:44.750
Days of control are over.

00:11:44.910 --> 00:11:46.390
There will be no other chances.

00:11:46.590 --> 00:11:47.270
Can't we talk?

00:11:47.490 --> 00:11:47.930
Silence!

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:49.380
I have spoken.

00:11:53.050 --> 00:11:55.610
Hereby strip you of the powers that you've squandered.

00:11:58.400 --> 00:11:59.970
Is your fallen emperor...

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:14.080
was her traveling vehicle. Not again. Yes, her traveling vehicle. You are now and forever

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:17.480
more banished from this place and from my sight.

00:12:31.950 --> 00:12:32.210
Kill it!

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:27.040
Geeks, they're bikes.

00:13:48.110 --> 00:13:54.220
What is it off of a f***ing f***ing skull?

00:13:55.630 --> 00:13:58.740
Don't look like your normal run-of-the-mill putties.

00:13:59.140 --> 00:13:59.980
They are Lord Zed.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:04.000
new army of putties i'm afraid they will be significantly more difficult to defeat

00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:08.430
i bet this attack was meant for us we've got to get there before they're hurt folk and skull

00:14:08.430 --> 00:14:29.980
it's more for time watch your back

00:14:30.510 --> 00:14:30.750
Tyler!

00:15:03.840 --> 00:15:13.440
Give up! We've got to find their weak spot!

00:15:13.580 --> 00:15:13.780
Ray!

00:15:15.550 --> 00:15:19.030
I betcha those gray guys are the reason Jason and those other geeks took off!

00:15:19.440 --> 00:15:19.780
Yeah!

00:15:20.570 --> 00:15:21.490
Hey, chicken, now!

00:15:21.990 --> 00:15:22.110
See?

00:15:22.910 --> 00:15:23.350
Gotcha!

00:15:45.550 --> 00:15:47.880
It's much longer. Come on, hang in there.

00:15:48.040 --> 00:15:49.020
There's gotta be a way.

00:15:49.890 --> 00:15:53.480
They're getting weak.

00:16:17.880 --> 00:16:19.510
Aim directly for the Z!

00:16:51.080 --> 00:16:58.780
Hey guys, let's get back to the command center.

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:11.980
Oh, nobody's gonna believe this.

00:17:12.750 --> 00:17:13.250
Well, prove it.

00:17:15.100 --> 00:17:16.140
They're real people, man.

00:17:16.850 --> 00:17:17.590
We heard the voices.

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:18.660
Hear them.

00:17:19.230 --> 00:17:20.010
We can touch them.

00:17:20.820 --> 00:17:23.300
We're gonna find out who they really are.

00:17:25.660 --> 00:17:28.280
Oh, I got a plan.

00:17:29.320 --> 00:17:29.960
This one is...

00:17:30.250 --> 00:17:36.830
really gonna miss me. Zordon, you were right. Those new putties are really strong. Way more

00:17:36.830 --> 00:17:42.330
than we anticipated. My powers failed me. If it wasn't for Jason. You were lucky to find their

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:47.820
weak spot so quickly. Apparently the Z on their chest is the source of their power. I'm sure

00:17:47.820 --> 00:17:52.630
Lorzade wasn't counting on us discovering it so soon. I wonder what he's got in store for us next.

00:17:53.290 --> 00:17:59.830
Got a feeling it ain't pudgy pig. There will be no more of Rita's inferior monsters. I will

00:18:00.030 --> 00:18:02.090
Create one of my own to be reckoned with.

00:18:23.460 --> 00:18:26.840
Lord Zedd has created a monster from a fish out of the Rampoon River.

00:18:27.140 --> 00:18:29.940
My censors tell me it was a piranha, now called Piranha.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:31.580
his head. As in man-eating?

00:18:31.760 --> 00:18:34.050
I'm afraid so. This monster has been

00:18:34.050 --> 00:18:36.290
sent to find you in Angel Grove. Tommy,

00:18:36.430 --> 00:18:38.010
you must stay behind temporarily

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:40.420
while the others morph. Alpha and I will try

00:18:40.420 --> 00:18:42.320
to re-energize your powers to make them

00:18:42.320 --> 00:18:45.780
stronger. Alright, guys. I'll be there as soon

00:18:45.780 --> 00:18:46.160
as I can.

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:58.990
Watch this, Power Rangers!

00:19:42.600 --> 00:19:44.460
It froze the swords. We're history
